# ---- graphify knowledge-graph output ----
# The brace form that used to live here (`!.../{graph.json,graph.html,...}`) was a NO-OP: git does
# not expand braces in .gitignore, so cost.json stayed ignored and the three files that ARE tracked
# only survived because they were added before the rule could bite. One negation per line.
**/graphify-out/*
!**/graphify-out/graph.json
!**/graphify-out/graph.html
!**/graphify-out/manifest.json
!**/graphify-out/cost.json
# GRAPH_REPORT.md needs a SECOND negation after the `*.md` block further down — this one alone is
# not enough, `*.md` matches later and last match wins. Both are required; keep them in sync.
!**/graphify-out/GRAPH_REPORT.md